{
  "$description": "Settings icons: one map for every platform (D3). Each group and page has one meaning and one glyph. A group's glyph differs from its pages' glyphs, except where the group has a single page. lucide = desktop and web (outline, 1.5 px stroke); material = the phone (androidx.compose.material.icons Outlined, or AutoMirrored.Outlined where marked); web = the console's <x-el.v2.icon> name where one exists. directional: flips in right to left.",
